<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C, Pass 24 — Zakkeg creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Zakkeg` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair, renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix. New `RSW_Zakkeg` BodyDef
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml) — entirely vanilla-part composition (Body/Tail/
  Spine/Stomach/Heart/Lung x2/Kidney x2/Liver/Hump/Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/
  Eye x2/Ear x2/Nose/AnimalJaw, Leg x4/FrontClaw x6/RearClaw x6) plus the
  already-ported `RSW_SW_Club`/`RSW_SWTailAttackTool` (Wave B) for the tail
  — no new part/group defs. New `RSW_Leather_Zakkeg` (donor-custom leather,
  texPath swresource/Leather_Scaled, an already-extracted shared texture).
  `specificMeatDef` (`Saurian_Meat`) ALREADY EXISTS as `RSW_Saurian_Meat`
  (Wave B). No egg comp (live birth via gestationPeriodDays/litterSizeCurve).
  Flagged, not fixed: the adult lifeStage's own vocal sounds are the donor's
  own bug — they point at `Pawn_Boma_*` (a DIFFERENT species' sounds), not
  `Pawn_Zakkeg_*`; ported byte-identical (pre-existing donor mismatch, not
  introduced here).

  `mandrake.rsw.zakkegartoverride` ships owner-approved art at the SAME
  relative texPath the donor uses (swanimals/Zakkeg/Zakkeg_{south,east,
  north}) — per the Anooba incident precedent, did NOT extract or ship
  those 3 facings, only `Zakkeg_Dessicated` (1 PNG).
-->
